- `apps/graph-manager/src/web/ui/base.css` (whole file, 262 lines) — the design-system classes: `.btn` (:37–59), form controls `.input/.select/.textarea` (:62–77), `.table-row` (:98–108), `.chip` (:118–122), `.segmented` / `.segmented-option` (:167–180), `.drawer*` (:184–197), `.dialog*` (:200–211), `.toast-stack` / `.toast-action` (:214–228).
- `apps/graph-manager/src/web/ui/tokens.css` (lines 5–10 light `:root`, 79–83 sizes, 98–102 dark) — `--sf` is `#ffffff` (light) and `#16181b` (dark); `--control-h: 36px`, `--control-h-dense: 32px`, `--row-h: 40px`.
