- `apps/graph-manager/src/web/pages/Terminals.css` (lines 44–47 `.tsb-item`, 73–84 `.terms-tab` 32 px / `.terms-tab-close` 18 px, 86–88 `.terms-layouts button` 30×26, 102–105 `.tp-head` height 32 px, 128–131 `.tp-icon` 22 px, 140–143 `.tp-foot` height 30 px, 155–158 `.tp-foot-chip` 20 px) — terminal controls that need the coarse hit area. Read only: put their coarse rules in `ui/base.css` (see GOTCHA), not in Terminals.css.
